WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.334 --> 00:00:16.421
Vinnie, Mandy, and Wayan's family passed farmers in the fields that surrounded the village.

2
00:00:16.422 --> 00:00:24.300
When they arrived in the center of the village, Vinnie and Mandy stopped to watch two men with swords.

3
00:00:24.301 --> 00:00:27.818
"Are they fighting?" Vinnie asked.

4
00:00:27.819 --> 00:00:32.479
"Long ago, warriors used to fight with those weapons.

5
00:00:32.480 --> 00:00:37.602
But now they use them for this dance," explained Nyoman.

6
00:00:37.603 --> 00:00:41.312
They all watched the men's careful movements.

7
00:00:41.313 --> 00:00:44.652
Their dance was smooth and graceful.

8
00:00:44.653 --> 00:00:48.327
Finally they reached a large field.

9
00:00:48.328 --> 00:00:51.827
There were many wooden carts on the field.

10
00:00:51.828 --> 00:00:55.461
"We're here!" Wayan exclaimed.

11
00:00:55.462 --> 00:00:59.829
"Help me tie the bar," his father instructed.

12
00:00:59.830 --> 00:01:04.878
Wayan and Vinnie placed a long bar on the oxen's necks.

13
00:01:04.879 --> 00:01:09.540
The bar connected two long sticks to a small cart.

14
00:01:09.541 --> 00:01:14.530
"Let's take them to the starting line," said Wayan's father.

15
00:01:14.531 --> 00:01:18.655
They joined a group of other men with their oxen.

16
00:01:18.656 --> 00:01:23.190
Wayan's father climbed onto the cart and stood up.

17
00:01:23.191 --> 00:01:26.921
He grabbed the rope reins to steer the team.

18
00:01:26.922 --> 00:01:32.419
"Ready!" shouted an elderly man with a red flag.

19
00:01:32.420 --> 00:01:35.194
He swung the flag down.

20
00:01:35.195 --> 00:01:39.365
All the oxen took off, pulling the carts.

21
00:01:39.366 --> 00:01:43.906
"Go, Budi! Go, Gede!" shouted Wayan.

22
00:01:43.907 --> 00:01:48.496
The crowd cheered as the oxen ran down the field.

23
00:01:48.497 --> 00:01:54.317
The race was only 100 meters long, but it was very exciting.

24
00:01:54.318 --> 00:02:00.145
"We won!" Wayan was jumping up and down with joy.

25
00:02:00.146 --> 00:02:04.327
"Congratulations!" Vinnie yelled.

26
00:02:04.328 --> 00:02:08.148
The other men congratulated Wayan's father.

27
00:02:08.149 --> 00:02:12.439
Wayan and Vinnie went to pet Budi and Gede.

28
00:02:12.440 --> 00:02:16.941
"Help me take this bar off, Vinnie," Wayan asked.

29
00:02:16.942 --> 00:02:20.662
"Let's take the oxen for a walk."

30
00:02:20.663 --> 00:02:23.753
The boys walked through the crowd.

31
00:02:23.754 --> 00:02:28.014
Some villagers stopped to congratulate Wayan.

32
00:02:28.015 --> 00:02:34.752
Meanwhile, Mandy and Nyoman walked among the crowd in the village.

33
00:02:34.753 --> 00:02:38.618
"What happens now?" asked Mandy.

34
00:02:38.619 --> 00:02:45.852
"Some people will go home and prepare for the Iron Fence festival," explained Nyoman.

35
00:02:45.853 --> 00:02:48.659
"It is being celebrated now.

36
00:02:48.660 --> 00:02:52.328
But my parents will attend a village meeting first."

37
00:02:52.329 --> 00:02:56.292
"What is the meeting about?" asked Mandy.

38
00:02:56.293 --> 00:03:02.218
"Today it will be about water for the rice fields," said Nyoman.

39
00:03:02.219 --> 00:03:06.080
"But they discuss lots of things at village meetings."

40
00:03:06.081 --> 00:03:10.757
Mandy suddenly realized Vinnie wasn't around.

41
00:03:10.758 --> 00:03:14.456
"Where are the boys?" she asked.

42
00:03:14.457 --> 00:03:22.594
"Wayan is probably showing off his oxen to his friends," laughed Nyoman.

43
00:03:22.595 --> 00:03:26.772
Soon the girls reached a large, open building.

44
00:03:26.773 --> 00:03:30.566
"What's this place?" asked Mandy.

45
00:03:30.567 --> 00:03:35.562
"This is the village community hall," replied Nyoman.

46
00:03:35.563 --> 00:03:39.315
"You don't know much about Bali, do you?"

47
00:03:39.316 --> 00:03:42.286
"No," said Mandy.

48
00:03:42.287 --> 00:03:45.074
"This is my first time here.

49
00:03:45.075 --> 00:03:48.928
So I really want to learn about your people."

50
00:03:48.929 --> 00:03:52.577
Nyoman smiled at her and said,

51
00:03:52.578 --> 00:03:59.667
"We are very friendly people, Mandy."
